<title>GHANA: Ghana stocks close hardly changed.</title>
<headline>Ghana stocks close hardly changed.</headline>
<dateline>ACCRA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghanaian shares closed hardly changed on Wednesday following their bearish start to the week.</p>
<p>The All-Share Index ended at 367.23, a touch higher than it's close at 366.97 on Monday. The total number of shares traded also improved slightly to 666,580 from 621,410.</p>
<p>Offers totalled 1.2 million shares.</p>
<p>Pioneer Aluminium Factory led two other gainers, adding five cedis to 165 cedis.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
